+//
+// Spoofs the full set of WebGL parameters (getParameter / getShaderPrecisionFormat
+// / getContextAttributes.antialias) with a self-consistent real-device config
+// selected by the --fingerprint seed. Data comes from
+// components/ungoogled/webgl_config_data.h.
